===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Talibans|Taliban}}

# Taliban, a member of the Taliban movement
#: {{quote|de|Ein junger '''Taliban''' zielte auf meinen Kopf.|ref=[http://www.welt.de/print-wams/article617718/Shelter-Now-Geisel-Ein-junger-Taliban-zielte-auf-meinen-Kopf.html]|A young Taliban aimed [his gun] at my head.}}

====Usage notes====
As the word ''Taliban'' is a plural form in the original language Pashto, the more sophisticated German singular is {{m|de|Talib}}. However, this latter form is less common in general usage.

